  message: "Closed wont_do per human confirmation 2026-04-27. Rationale per 2026-04-15 agent entry (uncontested for 12 days): (a) the specific motivating failure mode (bf4oxh91w duplicate smart-test) is now structurally prevented by the smart-test flock fix; (b) vendor-agnostic detection of in-flight background tasks would have to fall back to 'any background process for this user', which produces false positives (cron, other agents, tracker auto-sync) and an unreliable warning is worse than no warning. If a different shape of premature-action-under-stop-hook-pressure recurs with concrete evidence, file a fresh item with the new failure shape."  # 38ff
